Description: Data sets used by the 'SGP' package as exemplars for users to conduct their own student growth percentiles (SGP) analyses: wide and long format data sets for fixed-time and time-dependent analyses, a data set with the 2020 COVID-19 interruption, and an instructor-student lookup table for teacher level summaries.
